        "title": "Continental Interiors - Lewis+Clark, Livingstone+Stanley, Burke+Wills, Younghusband",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CONTEXT:\n    By 1800: coastlines largely mapped. Interiors blank.\n    \"Africa\" on European maps: coastal strip + speculation.\n    \"North America\" west of the Mississippi: unknown to Americans.\n    \"Australia\" interior: unknown.\n    \"Central Asia\": known routes, but unmapped systematically."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-CONTINENTAL-INTERIORS.md#004",
      "path": [
        "07-CONTINENTAL-INTERIORS.md"
      ],
