        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Continental Interiors - Lewis+Clark, Livingstone+Stanley, Burke+Wills, Younghusband",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MOTIVATIONS:\n    Africa: missionary work, anti-slavery movement, commercial.\n    North America: political (US sovereignty claims), commercial (fur, passage).\n    Australia: settlement, cattle routes, telegraph cable route.\n    Central Asia: the \"Great Game\" — Britain and Russia competing for influence."
    },
    {
